The character atlases (monster, bread, cat, dog and bear) were generated and
edited for PetLink using an AI image-generation tool. They use a transparent
4-by-2 grid: idle, two greeting poses and blink, with plain and scarf variants.

The unmodified Yozai Regular v0.868 font is from:
https://github.com/lxgw/yozai-font/releases/tag/v0.868
SHA-256: 25071998a0fe6a72f54c235e714986d259633e5ff670b1a2b5e264387f3316ac
Its copyright notices and SIL Open Font License are in
client/Resources/OFL-Yozai.txt (OFL-Yozai.txt in the App's Resources directory).

